{"id":"2e51855b95e81cff","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-omega.md","title":"Prefix-Free Halting Probabilities","display":"df-omega — Prefix-Free Halting Probabilities","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-omega","aliases":["43-df-omega"],"display":"df-omega — Prefix-Free Halting Probabilities","depends_on":["[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§8.2 and Theorem 9.2.5","source_printed_pages":"135; 171","source_pdf_pages":"155; 191","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-omega"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-omega</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega — Prefix-Free Halting Probabilities"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§8.2 and Theorem 9.2.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"135; 171"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"155; 191"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\">\\(M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}(M)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为固定通用前缀机器，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_M\\coloneqq\\sum_{p\\in\\operatorname{dom}M}2^{-|p|},\\qquad\\Omega_U\\coloneqq\\sum_{p\\in\\operatorname{dom}U}2^{-|p|}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Omega_M\\coloneqq\\sum_{p\\in\\operatorname{dom}M}2^{-|p|},\\qquad\\Omega_U\\coloneqq\\sum_{p\\in\\operatorname{dom}U}2^{-|p|}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>允许任意前缀机器的停止概率，通用机器情形是 Chaitin 的 Omega。数值存在且至多 1，由 Kraft 不等式保证。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§8.2 and Theorem 9.2.5；印刷页 135; 171，PDF 页 155; 191。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*$ 满足 $\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}(M)$；$U$ 为固定通用前缀机器，见 [[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrefixFreeMachine}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_M\\coloneqq\\sum_{p\\in\\operatorname{dom}M}2^{-|p|},\\qquad\\Omega_U\\coloneqq\\sum_{p\\in\\operatorname{dom}U}2^{-|p|}.","display":true}],"bytes":1317,"backlinks":[{"id":"74502ffee6b2f564","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]。固定 $U:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}$，满足 [[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]] 的 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$；$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega]]。$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}$ 见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-omega]] — Prefix-Free Halting Probabilities"},{"id":"d2937bc1068da255","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}$，且 $\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\ge N\\;X(n)=0$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)$ 采用 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 的序列谓词；$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega]]，$U$ 量化遍历部分二进制串函数。"},{"id":"c2784eb4c9c2da6f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}$ 满足 [[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]] 的 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$，$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega]]。$X\\in2^\\omega$ 满足"},{"id":"f487f6ba96a103ff","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U$ 满足 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$。$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega]]；$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-leftcomputable]] 的实数谓词与 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 的序列谓词；$X$ 量化于 $2^\\omega$。"},{"id":"a83a239aef6bae71","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce7890bf0705d554","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U$ 满足 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$，为通用前缀自由机器，$\\Omega_U$ 采用 [[43-df-omega]]；$\\alpha,\\gamma\\in\\mathcal L$，$\\mathcal L$ 与 $<_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-degree]]。"}],"outgoing":["f5078ab697e20add"]}